# ============================================================================
# Shared Database Configuration (Member 5)
# ============================================================================
# Option 1: Cloud PostgreSQL (Neon.tech / Supabase / Aiven / Railway)
# Copy this file to `.env` and set your PostgreSQL connection string:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@ep-example.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/equipment_maintenance_db?sslmode=require

# Option 2: Automatic Local SQLite Fallback (Default when DATABASE_URL is unset)
# If DATABASE_URL is omitted or left blank, src/database.py automatically uses:
# data/equipment_maintenance_db.sqlite
